message: "If you use this work in teaching or research, please cite it as below, and cite the original poem and the edition you consulted."
title: "Salalihini Sandeshaya: an immersive bilingual reader"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Salalihini Sandeshaya contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/WasathTheekshana/salalihini-sandeshaya"
