date-released: "2026-10-10"
keywords:
  - Sinhala
  - Sinhala literature
  - Sandesha Kavya
  - Salalihini Sandeshaya
  - digital humanities
  - education
abstract: >-
  A free, bilingual (Sinhala and English) reader for the fifteenth-century Sinhala messenger poem Salalihini
  Sandeshaya by Thotagamuwe Sri Rahula Thera, with explanations of every verse and an interactive 3D map of the
  starling's route from Kotte to Kelaniya.
